  "caveats": [
    "The responsive profile IS sigma/m-responsive (see responsiveness block); the inert phase39 profile is bit-for-bit invariant.",
    "gravothermal_yang2024.rho_sidm was inverted vs paper eq. 2.1 until 2026-11-04 (corrected; see the rho_sidm_source_agreement block) - this module re-implements eq. 2.1 independently and never called the broken form.",
    "Collapse time uses the BM2-calibrated normalisation, which the module's own comments note underestimates independent halos (e.g. Cosmo-501) by ~2.15x.",
    "sigma_eff/m is evaluated at one characteristic velocity, not MB-integrated.",
    "M_vir -> z_f -> t_evol uses a fixed concentration c=10; sensitivity reported.",
    "3-parameter fits (log_rho, log_r, ups_disk) for every model; no Occam penalty applied here (phase40 covers the full-physical-model penalty)."
  ]
}